WEBVTT

00:01:58.712 --> 00:02:02.069
and then also the technological side
of how we brought people together,

00:02:02.093 --> 00:02:03.875
how we could get people to commune

00:02:03.899 --> 00:02:05.604
and work together,

00:02:05.628 --> 00:02:09.616
small companies helping each other
I thought was really exciting,

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:12.125
and helping people do work
that mattered to them,

00:02:12.149 --> 00:02:14.860
and being able to strip away the muck,

00:02:14.884 --> 00:02:16.660
the things that matter a little less.

00:02:16.684 --> 00:02:18.079
AG: For many business owners,

00:02:18.103 --> 00:02:21.276
part of that muck was the perceived hassle
of renting office space,

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:23.928
and then creating a welcoming,
energizing environment.

00:02:24.619 --> 00:02:26.388
That's where Dave came in.

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:29.317
WeWork recruited him
to design all of their spaces

00:02:29.341 --> 00:02:31.397
and become one of their top executives.